Subject: [EXPERIMENT] ASoC: scope FullIO mute evidence to one graph lifetime

Commit only after validated DSP readback and DMA unmap. Invalidate on
prepare, stop, flush, close, or transport loss (even after reattach).
Recording evidence cannot start playback or enable protection clocks.

